WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.167
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to

00:00:02.167 --> 00:00:03.200
"The Tonight Show"!

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.467
You're here. You made it.

00:00:04.467 --> 00:00:06.467
Thank you for being here.
Thank you for watching.

00:00:06.467 --> 00:00:10.033
[ Cheering and applause ]

00:00:10.033 --> 00:00:12.534
Well, guys, Pfizer and Moderna
both say

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:14.634
that they're already working
on vaccines

00:00:14.634 --> 00:00:17.000
for the Omicron variant.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:20.000
While Johnson &amp; Johnson
is cheering them on.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.033
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:28.267
Yeah, Johnson &amp; Johnson is like,
"Guys, I thought we promised

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:29.901
we're not doing vaccines
this year.

00:00:29.901 --> 00:00:32.534
[ Laughter ]
Why would you embarrass me?"

00:00:32.534 --> 00:00:34.267
How'd they start working on this
so fast, too?

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:35.934
It's like when a team
wins the Super Bowl

00:00:35.934 --> 00:00:37.300
and the first commercial is,
"Buy your

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:38.934
Buccaneers Championship
hat now!"

00:00:38.934 --> 00:00:41.067
[ Laughter ]
You're like, "Wait."

00:00:41.067 --> 00:00:42.267
Meanwhile, officials
just announced

00:00:42.267 --> 00:00:46.300
that Omicron was present
in Amsterdam 11 days ago.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:47.868
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:49.968
It took a while to catch it
because, in Amsterdam,

00:00:49.968 --> 00:00:52.501
there's a very different meaning
to "a new strain going around."

00:00:52.501 --> 00:00:54.534
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:57.400
[ Clears throat ]

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.701
Yeah.

00:00:58.701 --> 00:01:01.100
Certain sections of our audience
got that faster

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.234
[ Laughter and applause ]
than others.

00:01:03.234 --> 00:01:05.634
Yeah, following the news
on the Omicron variant,

00:01:05.634 --> 00:01:07.934
the CDC is now saying
that all adults

00:01:07.934 --> 00:01:10.334
should get a booster shot.

00:01:10.334 --> 00:01:11.667
Right now, Instagram is like,

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:13.834
"Incoming booster selfies
in 3, 2, 1!"

00:01:13.834 --> 00:01:16.100
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:17.701
Well, guys,
tomorrow's December 1st

00:01:17.701 --> 00:01:19.534
and everyone's starting
to decorate for the holidays,

00:01:19.534 --> 00:01:21.767
so, the FAA
is warning people not

00:01:21.767 --> 00:01:23.667
to shine laser light displays

00:01:23.667 --> 00:01:25.834
into the sky.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:27.467
The pilots are actually fine
with the lasers.

00:01:27.467 --> 00:01:30.133
It's the emotional support cats
onboard that go nuts.

00:01:30.133 --> 00:01:31.734
[ Laughter ]
They're just like --

00:01:31.734 --> 00:01:33.367
[ Applause ]

00:01:38.467 --> 00:01:40.400
Well, this is cool --
Roomba updated

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.634
its latest vacuum cleaner
so that they use AI

00:01:43.634 --> 00:01:45.634
to avoid knocking over
Christmas trees.

00:01:45.634 --> 00:01:48.000
[ Laughter ]
But don't worry --
with the new update,

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.100
your Roombas will still inhale
the tree skirt,

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:51.767
until it blows up
and burns your house down.

00:01:51.767 --> 00:01:53.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.834 --> 00:01:55.334
It was kind of weird
when the Roomba

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:57.033
kept knocking over the
Christmas tree and then going --

00:01:57.033 --> 00:01:58.200
[ Robotic voice ]
Hanukkah rules.

00:01:58.267 --> 00:01:59.133
Hanukkah rules.

00:01:59.200 --> 00:02:00.701
Hanukkah rules.

00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:03.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.434 --> 00:02:05.968
Hey, I saw that a new study said
that babies start to develop

00:02:05.968 --> 00:02:09.100
a sense of humor
after one month.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.534
It's pretty obvious
when your baby's like --

00:02:10.534 --> 00:02:11.934
[ As Jerry Seinfeld ]
What's the deal with naps?

00:02:11.934 --> 00:02:13.501
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.501 --> 00:02:15.133
What am I so tired from?

00:02:15.133 --> 00:02:17.133
All I did before this
was sleep!

00:02:17.133 --> 00:02:18.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.701 --> 00:02:21.567
Soft foods, wearing diapers,
napping before sleep --

00:02:21.567 --> 00:02:22.934
I'm turning into Grandpa!

00:02:22.934 --> 00:02:27.300
[ Laughter ]

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:28.534
I wrote a full-on Seinfeld
-Wow.

00:02:28.534 --> 00:02:29.968
Fantastic.
-stand-up act as a baby, yeah.

00:02:29.968 --> 00:02:31.567
[ Laughter ]

00:02:31.567 --> 00:02:33.567
Get this -- I read that,
this year, in America,

00:02:33.567 --> 00:02:37.467
210 million packages
have already been stolen.

00:02:37.467 --> 00:02:39.133
[ Audience oohs ]

00:02:39.133 --> 00:02:40.601
Yeah, it turns out
those Ring doorbells

00:02:40.601 --> 00:02:41.701
were a lot more effective

00:02:41.701 --> 00:02:43.367
before everyone started
wearing masks.

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:45.901
[ Laughter ]
It's like, "Uh, yes,

00:02:45.901 --> 00:02:47.000
two humans?
I don't know.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:48.934
Does that help you, Officer?

00:02:48.934 --> 00:02:51.634
It wasn't a coyote that took
the package, yeah."

00:02:51.634 --> 00:02:54.868
[ Laughter ]
Finally, police in Germany
are looking for burglars

00:02:54.868 --> 00:02:57.100
who broke through the wall
of a toy store

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.801
to steal dozens of LEGO sets.

00:02:59.801 --> 00:03:01.400
The store was like,
"Ah, maybe we shouldn't have

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:02.801
built that wall with DUPLOs."

00:03:02.801 --> 00:03:04.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.734 --> 00:03:09.701
The thieves got away,
but said their one regret was

00:03:09.701 --> 00:03:11.634
robbing the place barefoot.
Ow!

